# Resume Strategy Engine — Implementation Plan

## Goal

Replace the current broken/generic "Strategy Report" modal with a fully redesigned, standalone **Resume Strategy Engine** page at `/resume-builder/strategy`. This feature will analyze the user's saved points (and optionally raw vault achievements) against a curated, domain-specific knowledge base derived from 88+ successful senior placement resumes. It will produce an actionable "resume playbook" telling users **what to keep, what to cut, and how to rephrase** — tailored to their target domain (Consulting, Finance, PM, Analytics, Software).

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **This is a significant new feature** that introduces a new page, a new backend endpoint, a pre-generated knowledge base, and deep integration with existing Point Bank and AI Refine workflows. Please review the overall approach before I begin implementation.

