### Component 3: Frontend — New Strategy Page

#### [NEW] `apps/web/src/app/resume-builder/strategy/page.tsx`

A dedicated full-page strategy experience with these sections:

1. **Setup Panel** (top)
   - Domain selector (Consulting, Finance, PM, Analytics, Software)
